{"id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-normal-form.md","title":"Boolean DNF over Modal Literals","display":"df-gl-normal-form — Boolean DNF over Modal Literals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-normal-form","aliases":["89-df-gl-normal-form"],"display":"df-gl-normal-form — Boolean DNF over Modal Literals","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-normal-form — Boolean DNF over Modal Literals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为既有字母和公式载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\)</span> 是含空值的有限序列折叠。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\Box}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为下文定义的模态文字与 DNF 类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 只作系统下标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\n\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box B,\\neg\\Box B:B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\left\\{\n\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma(i):i&lt;m\\rangle\n\\;\\middle|\\;\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\n\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box B,\\neg\\Box B:B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\left\\{\n\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma(i):i&lt;m\\rangle\n\\;\\middle|\\;\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 4–5（命题原子语义；本库展开）、92–96（区别于无字母正规形）；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>显式绑定整族有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>，修复原集合构造中只限制各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_i\">\\(\\Gamma_i\\)</span> 却未绑定该族的问题。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>；某项空合取给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。这是把盒子公式当作命题原子的普通析取范式，本库对第 1 章命题语义作的展开，并非原书第 7 章的无字母迭代盒正规形。后者单独由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"932deccafc8aeaa8\" href=\"?note=932deccafc8aeaa8\" title=\"89-df-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-letterless-normal-form</a> 定义。普通 DNF 不应被称为 GL 有限完全性证明的核心步骤。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"显式绑定整族有限序列 $\\Gamma$，修复原集合构造中只限制各 $\\Gamma_i$ 却未绑定该族的问题。$m=0$ 给 $\\bot$；某项空合取给 $\\top$。这是把盒子公式当作命题原子的普通析取范式，本库对第 1 章命题语义作的展开，并非原书第 7 章的无字母迭代盒正规形。后者单独由 [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] 定义。普通 DNF 不应被称为 GL 有限完全性证明的核心步骤。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\n\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box B,\\neg\\Box B:B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\left\\{\n\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma(i):i<m\\rangle\n\\;\\middle|\\;\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_i","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1681,"backlinks":[{"id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"此正规形是双模态无字母的特殊 CNF，不是 [[89-df-gl-normal-form]] 的一般单模态析取范式，后者不是本条数学来源。"},{"id":"db8da4f25311c498","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"588e8fcba7d283dc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般替换：[[89-lem-normal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-modalized-replacement]]。普通 DNF：[[89-df-gl-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-gl-decomposition]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","ca21b68a25f1afc2","932deccafc8aeaa8"]}